config VIDEO_HISTB_VDEC
	tristate "HiSilicon HiSTB video decoder driver"
	depends on ARCH_HISI || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on V4L_MEM2MEM_DRIVERS
	depends on VIDEO_DEV
	select MFD_SYSCON
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
	select V4L2_MEM2MEM_DEV
	select V4L2_H264
	help
	  Support for the VDH hardware video decoder of the HiSilicon HiSTB
	  set-top-box SoCs. The driver implements the V4L2 stateless decoder
	  interface: the bitstream is parsed in userspace and submitted through
	  request controls, and the hardware decodes H.264, HEVC, MPEG-2,
	  MPEG-4 and H.263 into NV21 frames.

	  Two hardware generations are covered.
	  v2 后端服务于 Hi3716CV200（HiVDHV200R004）、Hi3798MV100（HiVDHV300R001）与 Hi3798MV300（HiVDHV5R2C1）：三者都把完整解析的语法打包进下游消息池，前两者写 16x16 分块的帧，Hi3798MV300 按行优先写帧；V2 型号没有 HEVC 通路，所以 Hi3716CV200 上不提供 HEVC。
	  The v5 backend drives the HiVDHV5R6C02 block of hi3798mv200h, which takes a command
	  image and writes NV21 in 16-row bands.

	  后端后缀取的是它起步的硬件代，两个视频 block 里取法相同：v2 覆盖 VDH V2/V3 以及沿用其消息池的 V5R2C1 block，v5 覆盖 VDH V5R6。
	  It is not the vendor's vdec_vX.Y layer number, which counts
	  these parts the other way round (vdec_v1.0 for the v2 backends,
	  vdec_v2.1 for the v5 ones).

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called histb-vdec.
